{
    "title": "Words With Friends Word Game",
    "description": "OUR MULTIPLAYER WORD GAME is better and smarter than ever before! Beat this word jumble by unscrambling letters, train your brain and indulge in a plethora of classic word board games and crossword puzzles in Words With Friends! Expand your vocabulary and show off your spelling skills as you search for the highest scoring word in our beloved classic free word games.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nCREATE A GAME\r\n\r\n\u25ba The multiplayer board games showdown starts here. Keep up your brain training by challenging your friends and family members who love the scramble of classic crossword puzzle games, or use Smart Match to find your perfect opponent. Unscramble letters and search for the highest scoring words on the board and fill in the classic crossword style puzzle! Prove you have what it takes to become the word king or queen in this classic game.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nCOMPLETE WORD GOALS AND GET REWARDED\r\n\r\n\u25ba Play your best word tiles to complete goals to earn keys and unlock exclusive collectibles with Rewards Pass in this classic word game! With a new theme every 6 weeks, there is always something new and exciting to collect! In these classic word find games, climb the rewards track, beat a word hunt, and put your spelling skills to the test in this brain teaser and collect them all!\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nBOOST YOUR WORD GAME IN SOLO CHALLENGE\r\n\r\n\u25ba There is no need for multiplayer modes when you can play brain teasers against themed WordMasters as you attempt to beat the word scramble. Stay sharp in this classic word search game, because as you move up, the WordMasters will get tougher to beat.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nSWITCH IT UP WITH WORD WHEEL\r\n\r\n\u25ba Do you love word board games? Do anagrams get your brain wheels turning? Then this word app for android free is perfect for you! Beat these anagram puzzles by unscrambling letters, improve your spelling skills, and search for the right words as you challenge your brain by playing solo in this easy-to-play, limited time word connect mini-game. With so much variety, this word app has the perfect word games for everyone!\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nCUSTOMIZE YOUR WORD STYLE\r\n\r\n\u25ba In this classic free crossword game, you can show off your letter game and crossword puzzle games persona and play words with flair through Stickers, Tile Styles and Profile Frames!\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nWords With Friends is a free word knowledge board game, but you can play without third party ads between moves if you previously purchased either Words With Friends Pro or no third-party ads in the original Words With Friends word board game on any mobile device. \r\n\r\nBe sure to log in with Facebook or the email account you used to make the previous purchase to continue to play without third party ads between moves.\r\n\r\nCrossword puzzles, multiplayer board game, and word games aficionado? Like us on Facebook or follow us on Twitter to stay up-to-date on board game news, contests, polls and other fun stuff.\r\n\r\nhttps://www.facebook.com/WordsWithFriends\r\n\r\nhttps://twitter.com/WordsWFriends\r\n\r\nhttps://instagram.com/wordswithfriends\r\n\r\nhttps://youtube.com/wordswithfriends\r\n\r\nStep up your board game app play in one of the most fun, classic games on mobile! Download Words With Friends  today!\r\n\r\nWant more ways to play? Check out Words With Friends on web: http://www.wordswithfriends.com/",
    "descriptionHTML": "OUR MULTIPLAYER WORD GAME is better and smarter than ever before! Beat this word jumble by unscrambling letters, train your brain and indulge in a plethora of classic word board games and crossword puzzles in Words With Friends! Expand your vocabulary and show off your spelling skills as you search for the highest scoring word in our beloved classic free word games.<br><br><br><br>CREATE A GAME<br><br>\u25ba The multiplayer board games showdown starts here. Keep up your brain training by challenging your friends and family members who love the scramble of classic crossword puzzle games, or use Smart Match to find your perfect opponent. Unscramble letters and search for the highest scoring words on the board and fill in the classic crossword style puzzle! Prove you have what it takes to become the word king or queen in this classic game.<br><br><br><br>COMPLETE WORD GOALS AND GET REWARDED<br><br>\u25ba Play your best word tiles to complete goals to earn keys and unlock exclusive collectibles with Rewards Pass in this classic word game! With a new theme every 6 weeks, there is always something new and exciting to collect! In these classic word find games, climb the rewards track, beat a word hunt, and put your spelling skills to the test in this brain teaser and collect them all!<br><br><br><br>BOOST YOUR WORD GAME IN SOLO CHALLENGE<br><br>\u25ba There is no need for multiplayer modes when you can play brain teasers against themed WordMasters as you attempt to beat the word scramble. Stay sharp in this classic word search game, because as you move up, the WordMasters will get tougher to beat.<br><br><br><br>SWITCH IT UP WITH WORD WHEEL<br><br>\u25ba Do you love word board games? Do anagrams get your brain wheels turning? Then this word app for android free is perfect for you! Beat these anagram puzzles by unscrambling letters, improve your spelling skills, and search for the right words as you challenge your brain by playing solo in this easy-t